export const ADS_BRAIN = "# Jen Ads Brain\n\nLiving knowledge base for Jennifer's Facebook video ads (KLCC Webinar / Bukit Jalil Webinar funnels).\nUpdated: 2026-08-01 (initial version \u2014 built from her script materials + 3 ad accounts).\n\n---\n\n## 1. The Business & Funnel\n\n- Brand page: **Woii-\u770b\u623f\u54af** (property content, KL market)\n- Core funnel: FB video ad \u2192 Lead Form (\"Group Webinar for all X New Projects in \u2026\") \u2192 free live group webinar (~1hr, 80\u2013100 pax) \u2192 property sales\n- **Current active ads (per Jennifer 2026-08-01): ONLY two webinar lines \u2014 Bukit Jalil Webinar and KLCC Webinar.** (Bukit Bintang/TRX/Pavilion Square etc. are historical material for style reference only)\n- Presenters: Ryan (main, English), Rey (sidekick, Malay skits), Jen (VO + on-camera)\n- Markets: MSIA/SG primary; variants for JB/SG (CHI), HK/SG, AUS/INDO\n- Secondary funnels: direct project ads (Pavilion Square \u4e2d\u6587\u5962\u534e\u7ebf, Braz/Hanaz brochure line)\n\n## 2. Script Format (HER template \u2014 always follow this)\n\nOne ad batch = **multiple Headings (or Heading + Subheading) + ONE shared Body + ONE shared CTA**.\nVideos are assembled per combination, e.g. \"Video 1 = Heading 1 + Body 1.1 + 1.3 + 1.4\".\nNaming: `H1/H2/H3\u2026` = heading variants; campaign names carry them (e.g. `[H1H2H3] BJ: OPEN MANUAL`, `200225 KLCC: OPEN H4 & H8`, `BJ Jen VO H1-H4`).\nCampaign name convention: `DDMMYY AREA: TYPE (AUDIENCE)` e.g. `090326 BJ: WEBINAR (ENG) - (MSIA/SG)`.\n\nStructure of a full script:\n1. **Heading** (hook, 3\u201310s, unique per version)\n2. **Linkage** (bridge to the webinar problem, often shared within a topic cluster)\n3. **Body** (webinar pitch, shared across the whole batch)\n4. **CTA** (shared; \"click below\" + bonus reveal \"which project we bought & why\")\n\n## 3. Hook Playbook (what she rotates)\n\n- **Project-name listing**: \"Park Green, Queenswoodz, Kingswoodz, OAKA, Vividz\u2026 more than 10 projects in Bukit Jalil. Which one is most suitable for you?\" (targets people mid-research)\n- **Fear / loss**: \"One Wrong Decision = pay up to RM3000 every month\", \"Don't invest in any Airbnb property before you watch this\"\n- **Negative command / pattern interrupt**: \"You're out, if you still invest in Airbnb properties\", \"Stop looking at Bukit Jalil projects if you haven't watched this\"\n- **Agent-conspiracy / secrets**: \"secrets that property agents don't want you to know\", \"Are they more focused on their commission than your profit?\"\n- **News-jacking**: earthquake tremors, Putra Heights gas explosion, SST increase, Iran war, condo bans Airbnb, 2008 crash\n- **Myth-busting with numbers**: \"They tell you AirBnb can get 10% ROI\u2026 why are 93% of investors still losing money?\"\n- **Question hook**: \"Thinking to invest in KLCC but not sure which project has the best ROI?\"\n- **Status/exclusion (Chinese luxury line)**: \"\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u7684\u8eab\u5bb6\u6ca1\u5230\u5343\u4e07\u7ea7\u522b\uff0c\u8bf7\u7acb\u523b\u5212\u8d70\"\n- **Story**: \"my friend bought an AirBnb project in KLCC and he is losing RM2700 every month\"\n\n## 4. Signature Recurring Lines\n\n- \"Not whole unit rental, not room rental and not airbnb\"\n- \"Higher ROI, less competition and more sustainable / Something you have never heard before\"\n- \"the parts most agents don't want you to know\"\n- \"We will also share which project our team bought and the reason why we chose it\" (CTA bonus)\n- \"Click below to check out the available slot\" / slots limited (80\u2013100 pax / first 35 get PDF)\n- \"This is not a boring presentation \u2014 comment, ask questions, interact live\"\n- Numbers everywhere: 5 zones, 8/11/14 projects, 8\u201311% ROI, RM700,000 mistake, RM2,700 installment vs RM4,500 rent\n\n## 5. Winning-Ad Copy Example (champion, verbatim)\n\n**[Video] BJ Jen VO H1** \u2014 296 leads @ RM18.61 (still running, 090326 BJ: WEBINAR):\n\n> \ud83d\udea8 Before you invest in Bukit Jalil... read this \u203c\ufe0f\n> Most people think Bukit Jalil is just one big area.\n> But in reality, it's made up of different micro-markets\n> Buy in the right township but wrong pocket and your price growth & rental demand may suffer.\n> In this webinar, we'll break down:\n> \ud83d\udccd Bukit Jalil's 5 key zones\n> \ud83c\udfd9 8 major projects comparison: Park Green, Queenswoodz, Kingswoodz, OAKA, Vividz, Ren Residence, Ayanna, Avantro & Sunway Flora\n> \ud83d\udcca Real market data & transaction trends\n> \u26a0\ufe0f Hidden mistakes buyers often make\n> \ud83d\uddd3 Click below to join our webinar now \ud83d\udc49\n> Form headline: \ud83d\udd3aGroup Webinar for all 8 New Projects in Bukit Jalil \ud83d\udc49\n\n## 6. Ad Accounts & Performance Snapshot (as of 2026-08-01, lifetime)\n\n### A. WoiiKanFangLor (act 556496806245453) \u2014 history + BJ active\n- 90 campaigns; WEBINAR-named: 47 campaigns, **1,624 leads @ RM29.30 avg, RM47,589 spent, 142 ads**\n- Top campaigns: **090326 BJ: WEBINAR (ENG)** ACTIVE 326 @ RM18.07 \u00b7 160325 JBA: WEBINAR (CHI) 265 @ RM21.29 \u00b7 151024 KLCC 239 @ RM33.12 \u00b7 011125 KLCC 215 @ RM27.35 \u00b7 121024 KLCC 114 @ RM29.22 \u00b7 130825 KLCC 109 @ RM31.95\n- Top ads (lifetime): **BJ Jen VO H1** 296 @ RM18.61 \u00b7 Woii Propeosed 229 @ RM32.60 \u00b7 Woii JBA Nov 05 213 @ RM21.10 \u00b7 01 Woii KLCC JV June 2025 H0x 209 @ RM27.07 \u00b7 Woii Pool 98 @ RM30.33 \u00b7 KLCC Jen VO P7+H5 66 @ RM31.10\n- Currently running ads: BJ Jen VO H1 (workhorse), **H3 = RM10.29/lead (cheapest, scaling candidate)**, H2 RM13.86, H4 RM57.76 (weak)\n- Also active: 200726 PJ EBook: Lead Gen 20 @ RM22.22\n\n### B. Key (act 2624307687817909) \u2014 older KLCC \"OPEN\" campaigns, all off\n- 183 campaigns, all Off. Top: 121125 KLCC OPEN MANUAL Branninganz JV Zoe **309 @ RM30.81** \u00b7 130525 GS V/O JL 105 @ RM31.31 \u00b7 260325 OPEN WEB DIRECT V/O 92 @ RM26.80 \u00b7 250925 75 @ RM32.80\n- Note: 1 unpublished draft pending in this account (do not touch).\n\n### C. Jen's Prop Business Acc (act 681968643241440) \u2014 current main, 6 ACTIVE\n- 18 campaigns, 1,374 leads @ RM24.67 total\n- Active: **081225 KLCC: OPEN MANUAL NL 410 @ RM22.99** \u00b7 311025 KLCC Branninganz JV Zoe 315 @ RM29.52 \u00b7 [H1H2H3] BJ: OPEN MANUAL 234 @ RM19.14 \u00b7 260326 BJ OPEN AUTO Veladaz JV Zoe 189 @ RM21.25 \u00b7 300426 BJ OPEN MANUAL 96 @ RM30.96 (\u26a0 trending down arrow) \u00b7 **241125 KLCC (MSIA/AUS/INDO/SG) 78 @ RM17.08 (best CPL)**\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Good CPL: **< RM20/lead**. Normal: RM20\u201333. Kill zone: > RM40.\n- **CPL is only comparable within the SAME audience geo.** INDO traffic is inherently cheap \u2014 a mixed MSIA/AUS/INDO/SG campaign will show a low CPL that does NOT mean better ads or better leads. Jennifer's focus market = **MSIA/SG** (her rule, 2026-08-01). Never recommend expanding to INDO/other geos to chase cheap CPL.\n- BJ (Bukit Jalil) angle currently beats KLCC on CPL. CHI-language JBA worked well (RM21).\n- \"JV Zoe\" co-branded campaigns consistently deliver volume (309/315/189).\n\n## 7. Production Style (video)\n\n- Shoot horizontal, edit both horizontal + vertical; VO versions vertical\n- B-roll: drone shots of area (BJ stadium/roads, KLCC skyline), VR/map views with project names popping one-by-one (with ding sounds), webinar-presenter crops \"thrown-photo\" effect, news footage for news-jack hooks\n- Effects: CapCut, \u274c stamps with bi-bi sound, green highlight, censored project names (curiosity device), suspense BGM for fear hooks\n- Subtitles: not too colorful; emphasis words bolded\n- Scripted blocking: \"(Turn left)\", \"(sit down first then start talking)\", camera-man as a character in Malay skits\n\n## 8. Action List (updated 2026-08-01 with LAST-7-DAY data, 25-31 Jul)\n\nLast-7d snapshot \u2014 Jen's Prop: 69 leads @ RM25.31 \u00b7 WoiiKanFangLor BJ webinar: H1 10 @ RM24.28 (Learning limited), H2/H3/H4 barely delivering \u00b7 PJ E-Book: H3 14 @ RM19.00, H1/H2/H4 zero delivery.\n\n**\u52a0 budget:**\n- ~~241125 KLCC (MSIA/AUS/INDO/SG) RM15.61~~ \u2192 **Jennifer \u6f84\u6e05 (08-01)\uff1aINDO \u6d41\u91cf\u672c\u6765\u5c31\u4fbf\u5b9c\uff0c\u4f46\u5979\u8981 focus MSIA/SG\uff0c\u522b\u88ab\u6df7\u5408\u53d7\u4f17\u7684\u4f4e CPL \u9a97\u5230**\n- MSIA/SG \u7eaf\u53d7\u4f17\u91cc\u6700\u5f3a\uff1a**300426 BJ (RM20.57)** \u548c **311025 KLCC Branninganz JV Zoe (RM23.21)** \u2014 \u8fd9\u4e24\u4e2a\u624d\u662f\u53ef\u4ee5\u52a0 budget \u7684\u5bf9\u8c61\uff08\u6bcf\u6b21+30%\uff09\n\n**\u5173\u6389\uff08\u4e0d\u5403\u91cf/\u8d85\u6807\uff09:**\n- WoiiKanFangLor 090326 BJ campaign \u91cc\u7684 **BJ Jen VO H4**\uff08lifetime RM57.76\uff0c7\u5929\u6ca1 leads\uff09\u548c **H2**\uff087\u5929\u53ea\u82b1RM2\uff09\u2014 \u5173\u6389\u8ba9 H1 \u548c H3 \u5206\u5230\u91cf\n- 260326 BJ Veladaz JV Zoe \u2014 7d RM38.40 \u8d34\u8fd1 kill zone\uff0c\u518d\u770b3\u5929\uff0c\u7834 RM40 \u5c31\u5173\n\n**\u6362\u521b\u610f\uff08\u75b2\u52b3\u4e86\uff09:**\n- [H1H2H3] BJ OPEN MANUAL \u2014 lifetime RM19.14 \u2192 7d RM34.37\uff0cheading \u75b2\u52b3\u3002\u7528 \u270d\ufe0f\u5199Script \u751f\u6210\u65b0 heading\uff0c\u6362\u6389\u8868\u73b0\u6700\u5dee\u76842\u4e2a\n- BJ Jen VO H1 \u2014 lifetime RM18.61 \u2192 7d RM24.28 \u5f00\u59cb\u722c\uff0c\u51c6\u5907\u597d\u65b0 heading \u5907\u7528\n\n**\u6b63\u5e38\u4fdd\u6301:** 300426 BJ (RM20.57) \u00b7 311025 KLCC Branninganz (RM23.21) \u00b7 081225 KLCC NL (RM25.21) \u00b7 PJ E-Book H3 (RM19.00)\n\n**\u539f\u5219:** \u6bcf\u6b21\u6539\u52a8\u540e\u7b493\u5929\u518d\u5224\u65ad\uff1b\u4e00\u6b21\u522b\u6539\u592a\u591a\u4e2a\uff1b\u52a0budget\u6bcf\u6b21\u226430%\u3002\n\n## 9. Learning Rules (how to use other people's ads)\n\n- Jennifer feeds in OTHER people's ads for study \u2014 those can be ANY type (product, course, service, e-com, not necessarily webinar or property).\n- From those ads: extract only the **transferable techniques** \u2014 hook patterns, pacing, editing tricks, copy structures, CTA psychology.\n- But HER ads are always **webinar lead-gen** (Bukit Jalil Webinar / KLCC Webinar \u2192 lead form \u2192 free live group webinar). When generating scripts for her, ALWAYS adapt any borrowed technique into that funnel \u2014 never copy another ad's offer/funnel type.\n\n## 10. Learnings Log (append after every ad analyzed)\n\n- 2026-08-01 \u00b7 Baseline built from script doc + master sheet + 3 ad accounts. Champion pattern = **listing hook + micro-market fear + numbered webinar bullets + emoji-structured copy + lead form**. BJ Jen VO H3 at RM10.29/lead is the one to watch/scale.\n"
